>>> Dan Frasnelli said:
> > http://auctions.yahoo.com/auction/13338373
> > 
> > The seller claims it's a PWS500a. But the specs don't
> > really match my PWS500a. Do the specs match closer to
> > the XP1000? (except for the 21164a part).
