	Not totally correct. The 4.0 stream is a UFS system layout, with all files
accessable. However 5.0 is partially compressed to tar.Z formats for the
subsets. For the most part what is need for install Tru64 is uncompressed in
its final destination on the CD. So some libs will be there while others might
not.


